      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also think that adding it as a checkbox you can tick before hitting upload would be a good solution to this. Sometimes after I hit upload I stand up from my desk to do something else, only to come back and see the ownership agreement staring me in the face, and I have to wait until my avatar is uploaded.",
